let $X$ be the set of finite functions of the form $\chiup (a) ( \log \|a\|)^{r}$, with $\chiup \in C$ and $r \leqslant r_{\chiup}$, then for   any given $\varv \in H_{\infty}$ there are functions $\phi_{\xi}$ in the Schwartz space on ${\mathbb {C}} \times \mathrm{U}_2({\mathbb {C}})$ such that 
